title: MonkeyQuestComplete
tags: quests
---
<<if $Monkeyquest_status == "started">>
Monkey: Did you find my bananas?
-> Slimes: Yeah, we got them all!
    <<if $Monkeyquest_amount < $Monkeyquest_count>>
        Monkey: This isn't enough I'm going to need at least {$Monkeyquest_amount} bananas to fill up my hoard!
    <<elseif $Monkeyquest_amount == $Monkeyquest_count>>
        <<set $Monkeyquest_status = "completed">>
        Monkey: Thanks for all the bananas, Donkey Kong will be proud.
        Monkey: Here's a Mon-KEY for your troubles
        <<give_reward QuestGiverMonkey>>
    <<endif>>
-> Slimes: Not yet, were still missing some
    Monkey: Come back when you've got all the bananas!
<<elseif $Monkeyquest_status == "completed">>
    Monkey: Thanks for all the bananas, Donkey Kong will be proud.
<<else>>
    Monkey: Thanks for all the bananas, Donkey Kong will be proud.
    Monkey: Here's a Mon-KEY for your troubles
    <<give_reward QuestGiverMonkey>>
<<endif>>
===
